  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nicaragua, all united holding the achievements and consolidating the actions aimed at pre-elimination and elimination of Malaria - Nicaragua (01-Jan-2016-31-Dec-2018)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nicaragua, Malaria, Federaci&#xf3;n Red NICASALUD (NICASALUD)This program has the following goals: 60 percent reduction in P. vivax cases by 2018.  Zero cases of P. falciparum by 2018. The objectives of this program are: Improve promotion and communication for malaria, promoting strategic partnerships, family participation and community organizations that form part of the national response to malaria.  Improve the prevention, surveillance and early detection of malaria to control outbreaks, promoting vector control through strengthening IVM.  Strengthen the health system, strategic planning, monitoring, evaluation and operational investigations.  Strengthening early diagnosis and timely and full treatment with quality guaranteed in line with the national standard</narrative>
  </description>
